{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29766","headline":"景阳宫井双桐 · 李商隐","name":"景阳宫井双桐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋港菱花乾，玉盘明月蚀。\n血渗两枯心，情多去未得。\n徒经白门伴，不见丹山客。\n未待刻作人，愁多有魂魄。\n谁将玉盘与，不死翻相误。\n天更阔於江，孙枝觅郎主。\n昔妬隣宫槐，道类双眉歛。\n今日繁红樱，抛人占长簟。\n翠襦不禁绽，留泪啼天眼。\n寒灰劫尽问方知，石羊不去谁相绊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29766.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29766","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}